### Additional context

Regression from 1.2.9 -> 1.3.24, unsure which version caused it.

For anyone facing this particular problem, for now, the easiest solution is to change your schema definition for the date field to:
```ts
dateField: timestamp("date_field", { mode: "string" }),
```

Will not require a migration as this just changes Drizzle's behavior before db insertion. With this approach, be careful when accessing the date field on any instance of the user: it will not be a Date instance as the types suggest, it will instead be the ISO string representation.

